ent-ActionOpenNeuroInterface = open neural panel
    .desc = Project the neuro-interface control panel into your field of vision.
ent-NeuroInterface = NanoTrasen Neuro
    .desc = A compact neural bus implanted at the base of the neck. Its service lead can terminate beneath either ear.
ent-NeuroInterfaceInterdyneFault = Interdyne Fault
    .desc = A medical neural bus made by NanoTrasen competitor Interdyne Pharmaceuticals. It is optimized for coordinating several diagnostic and life-support augments at once.
ent-NeuroInterfaceNanoTrasenEnforcer = NanoTrasen Enforcer
    .desc = A restricted reinforced neural bus issued to NanoTrasen security and response forces. It is designed for high-load combat augments.
ent-BaseNeuroInterfacePart = neuro-interface component
    .desc = A replaceable component in a durable biocompatible shell.
ent-NeuroInterfaceChipBasic = NanoTrasen NMC-1
    .desc = The entry model of NanoTrasen's neuromorphic controller line, intended for standard augmentation suites.
ent-NeuroInterfaceChipAdvanced = NanoTrasen NMC-2
    .desc = A higher-density neuromorphic controller for complex civilian and industrial augmentation suites.
ent-NeuroInterfaceChipHighDensity = NanoTrasen NMC-3
    .desc = A restricted high-density neuromorphic controller built around a synthetic neural lattice.
ent-NeuroInterfaceCacheStandard = NanoTrasen NCM-2
    .desc = A neural context-memory unit that keeps two additional augmentation control states ready for immediate use.
ent-NeuroInterfaceCacheExpanded = NanoTrasen NCM-4
    .desc = An expanded neural context-memory unit that keeps four additional augmentation control states ready for immediate use.
ent-NeuroInterfaceRouter = NanoTrasen NAR-2
    .desc = A neural allocation router that maintains a strict service order for two augmentations.
ent-NeuroInterfaceRouterAdvanced = NanoTrasen NAR-4
    .desc = An advanced neural allocation router that maintains a strict service order for four augmentations.
ent-NeuroInterfaceRouterHighCapacity = NanoTrasen NAR-8
    .desc = A high-capacity neural allocation router that maintains a strict service order for eight augmentations.
ent-NeuroInterfaceEmpShield = ferrite EMP filter
    .desc = A layered ferrite filter that dampens electromagnetic interference before it reaches installed augment hardware.
ent-NeuroInterfaceEmpShieldHardened = isolated EMP filter
    .desc = A hardened optical isolator wrapped in a dense Faraday mesh. It strongly suppresses interference reaching installed augment hardware.
